From 7260f72fe7682d3c292a6b777ad83b32ca93f3ff Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FiyeroT <me@fiyero.xyz>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 17:44:47 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 124/126] go.mod: sing-shadowsocks2 with the input validation
 of UDP packets

a69d108 of upstream ("Fix protocol input validation", one commit after
v0.2.1). A Shadowsocks 2022 server could end the process with its first UDP
packet: session ID 0 left the cipher of the session nil. A padding length
past the end of the packet and a packet of a stream cipher shorter than its
salt are errors now too.
---
 go.mod | 2 +-
 go.sum | 4 ++--
 2 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

